# Leatherhead, Swamp Stalker: "you may remove a counter from her" needs her on the battlefield. Turn 3 Bot2 blocks her with a
# Ulvenwald Oddity (4/4): she tramples over for 1 and takes 4, so she dies as combat damage is dealt, and her trigger finds
# nothing to remove a counter from (nothing is asked: ! Bot1.Accept). Bot2's Mox Pearl survives, and the Oddity dies.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Leatherhead, Swamp Stalker
Forest x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Ulvenwald Oddity
Mox Pearl
Forest x16

